WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.120
Every enquiry begins with a possibility. But busy teams can lose momentum between the first message and the next step.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:17.304
Meet Shvya AI. Connect your lead sources, conversations, and sales follow-ups in one workspace.

00:00:17.304 --> 00:00:24.312
Sales cadence keeps the next action on track, with a structured rhythm of thoughtful follow-ups.

00:00:24.312 --> 00:00:29.928
AI playbooks use your business knowledge to guide more useful conversations.

00:00:29.928 --> 00:00:35.952
Connected workflows help your team move from a new enquiry to a clear next step.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:43.848
Bring enquiries from Meta lead forms, Google Sheets, IndiaMART, and Justdial into your sales process.

00:00:43.848 --> 00:00:53.328
Reconnect with interested leads. Understand what they need. Bring your team in when the conversation needs a person.

00:00:53.328 --> 00:01:05.136
Your business. Your sales process. More possibilities. Book a Shvya AI session, and see what your next conversation can become.
